      source: "Portrait painting (oil on canvas, signed and dated 1916) of Hendrik Lorentz by Menso Kamerlingh Onnes (1860-1925), Icones Leidenses, Leiden University Libraries (Icones 310), given by the sitter's family in 1931. The Leiden University Libraries item record and its IIIF manifest state 'The rights status of this resource is public domain' (Public Domain Mark), and the painter died in 1925. Downloaded from the library's IIIF image service at its full available size (1024 x 1276 pixels) and downscaled only, to 963 x 1200; no upscaling. The picture includes its frame with the Latin inscription naming Lorentz.",
